Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.07,0:00:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,苍…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.42,0:01:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你能看见七影蝶吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.13,0:01:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然之后不了了之
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.09,0:02:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,但那蝴蝶究竟是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.85,0:02:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,感想呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.97,0:02:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,不好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.68,0:02:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.85,0:02:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉  不小心说了真心话
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.69,0:02:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,,这算不上安慰
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.11,0:02:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,苍中午之前应该会过来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.15,0:02:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,先吃点凉快的东西等她吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.69,0:02:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.21,0:02:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,那是最后一支了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.88,0:02:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.01,0:02:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你想打听苍的事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.42,0:02:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.63,0:02:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我看你们最近经常在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.76,0:02:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,空门家的使命是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.35,0:02:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.64,0:02:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是岛上相关的事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.60,0:02:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,因为在山之祭期间
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.40,0:02:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,晚上是不能上山的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.86,0:02:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,苍也说过这事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.45,0:03:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,鸟白岛上以前
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.57,0:03:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,有被称作「御三家」的三大家族
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.45,0:03:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,空门家和鸣濑家
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.58,0:03:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,还有一个我不记得了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.46,0:03:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,只有空门家从以前开始就一直履行着一个使命
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.00,0:03:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,慢着
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.88,0:03:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,刚刚是不是轻飘飘地带过了鸣濑家
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.38,0:03:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,那是白羽你的家族吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.05,0:03:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,那是以前的事了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.67,0:03:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,现在已经没有任何使命了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.35,0:03:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,是天之空门  海之鸣濑
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.52,0:03:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,还有个山之什么家族
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.98,0:03:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,真少见啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.48,0:03:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,白羽竟然和别人在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.41,0:03:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,那个  昨天夜里的事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.71,0:03:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你在说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.79,0:03:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我昨天晚上很早就睡了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.21,0:03:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你是看到幻象了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.96,0:03:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,幻象…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.38,0:04:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,确实我看到的苍看起来很梦幻
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.34,0:04:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,非常美丽且神圣
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.72,0:04:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,美丽且神圣?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.51,0:04:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,就算你这么说  我也不会高兴的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.06,0:04:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,那果然是你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.60,0:04:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,如果  是我的话我肯定会这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.48,0:04:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你说谎可以更用心一些吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.23,0:04:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我想假装上当都显得很刻意
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.94,0:04:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我  我才没说谎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.74,0:04:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.99,0:04:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,真的是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.12,0:04:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,总之  你晚上不要再进山里了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.45,0:04:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这是这座岛上的规…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.17,0:04:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,这个点就打瞌睡吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.88,0:04:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,不过  我倒是明白你睡不够的原因了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.72,0:04:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,不好  快没电了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.64,0:04:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我的大腿借给你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.31,0:04:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,那我就借用一会…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.36,0:05:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,真的假的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.03,0:05:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,给我个…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.87,0:05:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,回去吧  天善
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.46,0:05:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,不买美味棒了吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.71,0:05:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,这种时候装作没看见才是男人的友情
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.17,0:05:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,再会了  老铁
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.09,0:05:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,祝你幸福
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.17,0:05:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,天善  开冲
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.17,0:05:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,冲
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.89,0:05:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,多谢款待
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.93,0:05:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,怎…怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.10,0:05:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,夜晚最好不要靠近山
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.35,0:05:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,苍都这么说了  还是照做比较好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.70,0:05:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,真是在哪都能睡啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.55,0:06:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,嘭?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.97,0:06:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,这可不妙
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.40,0:06:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么情况  脸好近
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.95,0:06:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,各种位置都好软
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.62,0:06:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,还有股好闻的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.71,0:06:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,那个  这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.50,0:06:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,请随意享用
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.01,0:06:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,早安
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.14,0:06:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,为…为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.64,0:07:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我第一个想要女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.10,0:07:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,冷静点
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.15,0:07:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然我不讨厌强硬的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.40,0:07:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,但这里是外头
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.15,0:07:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,所以说先冷静点
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.65,0:07:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我是在被你抱着
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.45,0:07:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,放开我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.24,0:07:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,是你要放开我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.58,0:07:16.24,Comment,,0,0,0,,嘭
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.54,0:07:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,那个  总觉得对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.00,0:07:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.83,0:07:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,果然昨晚也因为使命熬夜了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.71,0:07:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.38,0:07:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,那今晚也要去吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.55,0:07:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我再说一遍
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.18,0:07:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,晚上绝对不能跑进山里哦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.51,0:07:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我这么说可是为了你好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.48,0:07:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然她这么说  但我还是来了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.32,0:07:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,苍?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.82,0:07:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我记得苍碰过这只蝴蝶…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.62,0:08:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么会变成这样
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.21,0:08:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,还给我  把妻子和女儿还给我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.59,0:08:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么只有我活下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.13,0:08:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,让我从痛苦中解脱吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.30,0:08:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在就去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.10,0:08:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我也会前往你们身边
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.52,0:08:21.52,Comment,,0,0,0,,身体不听使唤了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.18,0:08:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,发生了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.10,0:08:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,但是这样就…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.27,0:08:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,可以解脱了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.79,0:08:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,羽依里
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.33,0:08:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的  你个笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.43,0:08:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我告诉过你晚上不要来山里的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.97,0:08:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,苍  我这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.93,0:09:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你碰到了七影蝶
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.85,0:09:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,所以记忆和别人的混在一起了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.10,0:09:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,七影蝶到底是什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.19,0:09:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,那是以蝴蝶形态存在的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.03,0:09:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,对人世还存有留恋的人的记忆残渣
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.49,0:09:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,碰到的话  就会亲身体会那个人的记忆
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.66,0:09:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,这种蝴蝶
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.91,0:09:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,明明只有感性很强的人或者动物才看得见的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.83,0:09:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,苍  你的使命究竟是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.79,0:09:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,把迷路的蝴蝶聚集起来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.05,0:09:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,引导它们回到该去的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.51,0:09:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是空门家的使命
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.59,0:09:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,到这里应该能自己回去了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.55,0:09:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,苍你还不回去吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.77,0:09:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我还要继续履行使命
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.23,0:09:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,夜晚的山中的可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.60,0:09:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你也体会到了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.31,0:09:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,别再靠近了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.69,0:09:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.90,0:09:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.94,0:09:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,这些叫七影什么蝶
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.24,0:09:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,苍你也碰过了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.99,0:09:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.20,0:10:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直在触摸它们
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.58,0:10:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,多少有一些抵抗力了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.04,0:10:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,这也是因为使命吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.58,0:10:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我有必须要找到的记忆
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.46,0:10:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,不惜冒着危险也要找到吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.64,0:10:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,明天可以陪我一会吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.36,0:10:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.20,0:10:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我是苍
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.49,0:10:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我进来了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.49,0:10:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,打扰了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.16,0:10:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我来了哦  蓝
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.08,0:10:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,蓝?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.88,0:10:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯  空门蓝
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.88,0:10:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,是我的双胞胎姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.51,0:11:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,今天去小蓝那边了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.89,0:11:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,估计是要做检查吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.68,0:11:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,今天我带朋友来看你了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.85,0:11:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,之前和你提过的  还记得吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.85,0:11:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,就是过世的加藤奶奶的亲戚
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.86,0:11:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,蓝以前遭遇了意外
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.36,0:11:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,从那以后就一直这样睡着了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.78,0:11:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.91,0:11:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我昨天晚上和你说过吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.29,0:11:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我有必须要找到的记忆
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.83,0:11:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是蓝的记忆
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.54,0:11:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,加藤奶奶和我讲过
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.63,0:11:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,这座岛上有着一个
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.88,0:11:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,能让一直沉睡的人苏醒的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.68,0:11:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,不可思议的蝴蝶的故事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.55,0:11:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我外婆说的?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.35,0:11:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,也许只是为了让我振作而编造的故事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.27,0:11:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.48,0:11:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,考虑到空门家的使命以及七影蝶
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.61,0:11:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我不认为那是谎话
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.40,0:12:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我在执行使命时触摸七影蝶
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.74,0:12:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,寻找蓝的记忆…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.49,0:12:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,很困吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.45,0:12:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉  我能小睡一会吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.75,0:12:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,当然
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.21,0:12:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,30分钟后叫醒我…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.98,0:12:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨  晚上好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.44,0:12:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,稻荷也好哦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.11,0:12:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,嘭
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.20,0:12:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我说过不要跑进山吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.74,0:12:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,是说过  但我可没有答应
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.49,0:12:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么就听不懂呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.16,0:12:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,寻找七影蝶真的很危险
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.33,0:12:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我才来了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.21,0:13:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,既然你正在做危险的事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.75,0:13:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,至少让我陪在你身边
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.09,0:13:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.68,0:13:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是说那个吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.10,0:13:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你迷上我啦?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.18,0:13:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.77,0:13:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,可不止一点迷上了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.81,0:13:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你是认真的?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.40,0:13:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你很难办?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.40,0:13:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,可不止一点难办
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.23,0:13:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,有点受打击啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.49,0:13:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,因为现在的我顾不上那些事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.16,0:13:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,满脑子都在想着寻找蓝的七影蝶
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.50,0:13:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,那样的话比起一个人  两人一起找不是更好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.00,0:13:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,岛上的居民碍于规矩不能进山
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.09,0:13:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,但我可不是岛上的人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.26,0:13:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我可以帮助你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.72,0:13:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,知…知道啦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.97,0:13:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,大概就算我拒绝你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.39,0:13:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你也会擅自跟来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.44,0:14:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,作为条件  你要答应我不能离开我身边
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.07,0:14:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.61,0:14:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我绝对不会离开你身边的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.33,0:14:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.66,0:14:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我和苍以及稻荷
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.00,0:14:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,开始一同寻找蓝的七影蝶
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.91,0:15:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,迷失橘
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.54,0:15:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这是空门家的神木
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.88,0:15:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,橘树本来应该在夏天之前开花
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.88,0:15:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,但这棵树会稍微迟一些
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.26,0:15:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,生长在与现世稍稍相错的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.26,0:15:59.27,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs35}注 : 日本神道教将人类所处的世间称为「现世」，与之相对的称为「常世」
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.59,0:15:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,稍稍相错的时间
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.60,0:15:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,立于现世常世的交界
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.81,0:15:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,成为神木
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.57,0:16:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,只有在这棵树开花的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.32,0:16:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,才能用提灯指引七影蝶
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.12,0:16:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是山之祭的时候吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.42,0:16:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.25,0:16:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,于是啊  野美希满脸通红闭上了嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.34,0:16:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,那个  你一直对睡着的蓝说话
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.89,0:16:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,是有什么效果吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.77,0:16:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,跟睡眠学习差不多?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.64,0:16:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,如果蓝醒来时  还记得我说的话
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.77,0:16:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,就像我们一直都在一起一样
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.27,0:16:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.65,0:16:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,机会难得  你也跟蓝说点什么吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.36,0:16:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,确实机会难得  我从自我介绍开始
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.58,0:17:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我是苍的…恋人  鹰原羽依里
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.04,0:17:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么就是恋人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.91,0:17:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,还早吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.17,0:17:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我想利用睡眠学习提前准备
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.00,0:17:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然被你这样说…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.01,0:17:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,还挺开心的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.22,0:17:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我也喜欢上你了…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.26,0:17:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,苍
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.27,0:17:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,但是  对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.02,0:17:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能丢下沉睡的蓝  自己一个人幸福
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.02,0:17:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然这么说很不公平
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.44,0:17:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,但我希望你等到蓝醒来那天
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.32,0:17:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,真伤脑筋啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.11,0:17:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.07,0:17:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,寻找蓝记忆这件事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.99,0:17:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,已经不能是帮忙了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.08,0:17:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,只要蓝醒过来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.12,0:17:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我就能和苍成为恋人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.37,0:17:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,那这件事已经成为我的目标了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.29,0:17:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,是变成这样了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.76,0:17:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,是的  我现在满是干劲
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.59,0:18:02.89,Comment,,0,0,0,,6月王牌三村因状态不佳退场之后
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.89,0:18:04.39,Comment,,0,0,0,,海星队便陷入苦战
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.56,0:18:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,镜子阿姨
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.06,0:18:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我有件事想打听
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.10,0:18:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,什么事呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.31,0:18:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我听说这座岛上有能让沉睡的人苏醒的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.69,0:18:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,不可思议的蝴蝶的故事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.11,0:18:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你是说七影蝶吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.99,0:18:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不会吧  还有书留着吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.20,0:18:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,好像是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.62,0:18:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我拜托镜子阿姨从仓库找出来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.95,0:18:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,是这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.20,0:18:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,加藤奶奶的仓库的话确实有可能
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.87,0:18:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,明天来我家吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.12,0:18:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯  我去
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.00,0:18:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊  感觉今晚有干劲了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.13,0:18:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,好  加油吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.71,0:18:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,嘭
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.93,0:18:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,好困
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.68,0:18:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,看来差不多到极限了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.72,0:18:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,还早呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.72,0:18:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,稻荷  下一个
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.64,0:18:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,嘭
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.44,0:18:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我牵着你手回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.36,0:18:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,那好像不错
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.32,0:18:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.40,0:18:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,奇怪  刚才我说什么了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.91,0:19:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,大概把心里话说出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.57,0:19:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,那…那不行吧  这是外面
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.12,0:19:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,不管怎么说
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.08,0:19:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,第一次要在有枕头的地方…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.21,0:19:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉  看来还没说出来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.25,0:19:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,不过  我知道你到极限了  所以回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.09,0:19:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.73,0:19:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,魔王炎杀光龙波
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.94,0:19:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,魔王…炎杀?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.70,0:19:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你在做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.20,0:19:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,小羽未
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.62,0:19:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫你好几次了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.20,0:19:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,已经没有早饭吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.70,0:19:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.00,0:19:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么起不来呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.91,0:19:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,谁让你整晚都在玩
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.34,0:19:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,七影蝶?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.14,0:20:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,羽依里
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.47,0:20:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,在
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.43,0:20:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,有客人来了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.68,0:20:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.39,0:20:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,打扰了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.19,0:20:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你在紧张什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.02,0:20:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我第一次进男孩的房间
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.40,0:20:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,而且一来就看见铺好了床
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.99,0:20:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.11,0:20:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,镜子阿姨和小羽未都在
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.78,0:20:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为我会做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.83,0:20:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,说的也是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.16,0:20:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,比起那个  你看
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.58,0:20:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这是镜子阿姨找到的书
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.00,0:20:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,因为太久远了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.17,0:20:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我完全没看懂内容
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.05,0:20:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,这是天保时代的文献呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.10,0:20:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你能看懂吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.47,0:20:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,触摸七影蝶就能体验那个人的记忆对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.10,0:20:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,所以也能学到各种知识
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.73,0:20:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,那不是很厉害吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.27,0:20:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我以前也说过吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.73,0:21:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我见识还挺广的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.57,0:21:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,不是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.49,0:21:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,这里写着如何让七影蝶回到沉睡身体里的方法
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.83,0:21:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.70,0:21:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯  这是我一直寻找的知识
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.04,0:21:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,太棒啦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.67,0:21:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,苍
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.63,0:21:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,各种方面接触到了…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.63,0:21:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,对…对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.67,0:21:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我有些兴奋过头了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.14,0:21:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我很开心倒也无所谓了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.80,0:21:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,那个具体方法是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.22,0:21:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,就是…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.52,0:21:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,先找到蓝的七影蝶…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.56,0:21:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,然后就用吕字…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.36,0:21:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,吕字?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.36,0:21:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,总之找到蓝的七影蝶就完全解决了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.20,0:21:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,是这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.16,0:21:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,羽依里  谢谢你
Comment: 0,0:00:00.98,0:00:00.98,Comment,,0,0,0,,

